30], [1198, 560], [909, 553]]}, {"text": "tense of the 'be' form of verb. Where' is used as an adverb and", "conf": 0.9, "box": [[100, 546], [866, 553], [865, 585], [99, 579]]}, {"text": "meaning also.", "conf": 0.886, "box": [[909, 560], [1063, 560], [1063, 587], [909, 587]]}, {"text": "were'Itis used as a verb.", "conf": 0.838, "box": [[101, 591], [407, 591], [407, 618], [101, 618]]}, {"text": "a.", "conf": 0.66, "box": [[98, 633], [125, 633], [125, 660], [98, 660]]}, {"text": "The Olympic Games were completely forgotten.", "conf": 0.949, "box": [[180, 628], [755, 635], [755, 667], [180, 660]]}, {"text": "b.", "conf": 0.664, "box": [[94, 666], [128, 666], [128, 702], [94, 702]]}, {"text": "Where can we find the original stadium?", "conf": 0.886, "box": [[177, 667], [669, 674], [668, 707], [177, 700]]}, {"text": "2 Fill in the blanks using the correct homophones.", "conf": 0.897, "box": [[112, 733], [755, 739], [755, 772], [112, 765]]}, {"text": "a. Among the colours that represent all nations, the colour of the flag that looks prominent", "conf": 0.945, "box": [[92, 791], [1215, 802], [1215, 838], [91, 827]]}, {"text": "is", "conf": 0.666, "box": [[134, 849], [166, 849], [166, 880], [134, 880]]}, {"text": ". (blew/blue)", "conf": 0.891, "box": [[294, 848], [455, 850], [455, 884], [294, 882]]}, {"text": "b. It motivated Pierre de Coubertin _ start the Olympics again. (to/two)", "conf": 0.918, "box": [[91, 901], [1020, 914], [1019, 950], [90, 937]]}, {"text": "c. The Modern Olympics", "conf": 0.861, "box": [[92, 962], [408, 964], [408, 994], [91, 991]]}, {"text": "organised to acknowledge the talents of every", "conf": 0.925, "box": [[539, 961], [1123, 975], [1122, 1008], [538, 994]]}, {"text": "individual. (where/were)", "conf": 0.913, "box": [[134, 1016], [427, 1019], [427, 1049], [134, 1046]]}, {"text": "d.", "conf": 0.655, "box": [[89, 1069], [121, 1069], [121, 1102], [89, 1102]]}, {"text": "did they hold the first Modern Olympic Games? (Where/Were)", "conf": 0.